        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="spec__foot" style="border-top: none; padding-top: 0; justify-content: flex-start; gap: 12px;">
        <a href="https://github.com/eq1024/turborepo-starter" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn--primary">GitHub ↗</a>
      </div>
    </article>

